    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29321" root="عصر" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصِيرٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْصُورٌ</span></b>  [<i>Pressed,</i> or <i>squeezed,</i> or
<i>wrung, so that its juice, sirup, honey, oil, water,</i>
or <i>moisture, is forced out</i>]; (K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَصْرٌ</span></b> .
(TA.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُصَارَةٌ</span>, in two places.

